OL,3,GNEWSA'Nothing' done to keep family safe
OL,4,Aafter 999 call
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer has admitted "nothing"
OL,7,Fwas done to keep a mother and her four
OL,8,Fchildren safe, despite making a 999
OL,9,Fcall hours before being murdered in an
OL,10,Farson attack.
OL,12,FAt an inquest at Bolton Coroner's
OL,13,FCourt, PC Mike Grundy said he did not
OL,14,Fthink there was a "risk of fire" at the
OL,15,Fhome of Michelle Pearson and her four
OL,16,Fchildren in Walkden, Salford - despite
OL,17,FZak Bolland making previous threats to
OL,18,F"petrol bomb" the property.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
