OL,3,GNEWSA'Nothing' done to keep family safe
OL,4,Aafter 999 call
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour of Michelle's children were
OL,7,Fmurdered in the arson attack on 11
OL,8,FDecember 2017; Michelle, 37, died in
OL,9,FAugust 2019, after being badly burned.
OL,11,FBolland and David Worrall were jailed
OL,12,Ffor life in 2018 for the murder of the
OL,13,Ffour children, and convicted in 2021 of
OL,14,FMichelle's murder.
